  "contract": "Firepot 500601 states that the Firepot Drone drops firepots on the ground beneath it as it flies to its target and that the amount dropped is based on distance travelled. Live combat logs (C:/CoA/SUB/old-logs, 2026-07/08, 1975 drones) show one drop about every second of flight, so a 34-yard flight drops at least three firepots before its landing explosion, and each oil cast 500753 follows a drop. The installed Spell.dbc 500601 hits at most 5 targets (MaxAffectedTargets) in a 5-yard radius around its ground destination, so a drop over seven clustered enemies damages only five of them; the drop selects targets in GUID order, so the two enemies spawned last stay untouched. The first drop happens while the drone is still flying, and its oil lies on the ground beneath it.",
